<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Sopa Criolla de Res y Raíces · Receta exacta para 3 (sin sobras)</title>
<meta name="description" content="Receta completa de sopa criolla con res, yuca, ñame, auyama, maíz y verduras. Cantidades exactas para 2 adultos y 1 niña de 2 años, con equilibrio nutricional y guía infantil.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#B84A1F">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,600;9..144,800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ============ 1. TOKENS Y RESET ============ */
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

:root{
  --cream:#FBF7F0;
  --paper:#FFFFFF;
  --ink:#2B2118;
  --ink-soft:#6B5D51;
  --terracotta:#B84A1F;
  --terracotta-dk:#8A3414;
  --amber:#E8A33D;
  --green:#3E5641;
  --green-soft:#EDF2ED;
  --line:#EADFCF;
  --radius:20px;
  --shadow-sm:0 2px 10px rgba(43,33,24,.06);
  --shadow:0 18px 46px -20px rgba(43,33,24,.38);
  --max:1140px;
}

html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}

body{
  font-family:'Inter',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;
  background:var(--cream);
  color:var(--ink);
  line-height:1.65;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}

h1,h2,h3,.brand{font-family:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.015em}

img,svg{display:block;max-width:100%}

.wrap{width:min(100% - 2rem,var(--max));margin-inline:auto}

/* ============ 2. BARRA SUPERIOR ============ */
.topbar{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;
  background:rgba(251,247,240,.86);
  backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
.topbar-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding:.7rem 0}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;font-weight:800;font-size:1rem}
.brand-dot{
  width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;flex:0 0 auto;
  background:conic-gradient(from 200deg,var(--terracotta),var(--amber),var(--green),var(--terracotta));
  box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(184,74,31,.12);
}
.nav{display:flex;gap:1.4rem;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:500}
.nav a{color:var(--ink-soft);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s}
.nav a:hover{color:var(--terracotta)}
@media(max-width:820px){.nav{display:none}}

.btn-cta{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;
  background:var(--terracotta);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;
  font-weight:600;font-size:.88rem;padding:.6rem 1.15rem;border-radius:999px;
  transition:transform .2s,background .2s,box-shadow .2s;
  box-shadow:0 6px 18px -8px rgba(184,74,31,.9);
}
.btn-cta:hover{background:var(--terracotta-dk);transform:translateY(-2px)}

/* ============ 3. HERO ============ */
.hero{
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:#FBF7F0;
  background:linear-gradient(150deg,#6E2A11 0%,#B84A1F 48%,#D9772F 100%);
  padding:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4.5rem) 0 clamp(3rem,7vw,5rem);
}
.hero::after{
  content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;
  background:
    radial-gradient(58% 58% at 88% 12%,rgba(232,163,61,.38),transparent 70%),
    radial-gradient(52% 52% at 6% 92%,rgba(62,86,65,.42),transparent 70%);
}
.hero-grid{
  position:relative;z-index:1;
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;
  gap:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,3.5rem);align-items:center;
}
@media(max-width:880px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.eyebrow{
  display:inline-block;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--amber);margin-bottom:1rem;
}
.hero h1{
  font-size:clamp(2.1rem,6.2vw,4rem);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:1rem;
  text-wrap:balance;
}
.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--amber)}
.hero-lead{font-size:clamp(1rem,2.1vw,1.12rem);color:rgba(251,247,240,.86);max-width:46ch;margin-bottom:1.6rem}

.badges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem}
.badge{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;
  font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;padding:.42rem .85rem;border-radius:999px;
  background:rgba(251,247,240,.14);border:1px solid rgba(251,247,240,.3);
  color:#FBF7F0;
}

/* Ficha técnica */
.ficha{
  background:rgba(251,247,240,.11);
  border:1px solid rgba(251,247,240,.28);
  border-radius:26px;padding:1.5rem;
  backdrop-filter:blur(8px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
  box-shadow:0 24px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.6);
}
.ficha h2{font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--amber);margin-bottom:1.1rem;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-weight:700}
.ficha-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.1rem}
.ficha-item strong{display:block;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.1}
.ficha-item span{font-size:.76rem;color:rgba(251,247,240,.72);letter-spacing:.02em}

/* ============ 4. SECCIONES ============ */
section{padding:clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.5rem) 0}
.sec-head{max-width:62ch;margin-bottom:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem)}
.sec-head .eyebrow{color:var(--terracotta);margin-bottom:.6rem}
.sec-head h2{font-size:clamp(1.65rem,4vw,2.5rem);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:.7rem;text-wrap:balance}
.sec-head p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:1.02rem}

/* ============ 5. CONMUTADOR ============ */
.switch-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.4rem}
.seg{
  display:inline-flex;background:#F1E8DA;border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:999px;padding:4px;gap:2px;
}
.seg-btn{
  border:0;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;
  font-family:inherit;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-soft);
  padding:.55rem 1.1rem;border-radius:999px;transition:all .22s;
}
.seg-btn.active{background:var(--paper);color:var(--terracotta);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
.seg-note{font-size:.83rem;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:44ch}

/* ============ 6. TABLAS ============ */
.tbl-wrap{
  background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);overflow:hidden;
}
table.tbl{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.93rem}
table.tbl thead th{
  text-align:left;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:700;padding:.95rem 1.2rem;
  background:#F7F0E5;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
table.tbl td{padding:.8rem 1.2rem;border-bottom:1px solid #F4EDE2;vertical-align:top}
table.tbl tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
table.tbl tbody tr:hover{background:#FDFAF5}
.qty{font-weight:700;color:var(--terracotta);white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.note{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.86rem}

@media(max-width:660px){
  table.tbl thead{display:none}
  table.tbl,table.tbl tbody,table.tbl tr,table.tbl td{display:block;width:100%}
  table.tbl tr{
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;
    padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-bottom:.65rem;background:var(--paper);
  }
  table.tbl td{border:0;padding:.28rem 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;text-align:right}
  table.tbl td::before{
    content:attr(data-label);font-weight:700;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);text-align:left;flex:0 0 auto;
  }
  .tbl-wrap{background:transparent;border:0;box-shadow:none}
}

/* ============ 7. TARJETAS DE BALANCE ============ */
.bal-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(235px,1fr));gap:1rem}
.bal-card{
  background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;
  padding:1.3rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);transition:transform .25s,box-shadow .25s;
}
.bal-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.bal-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;margin-bottom:.85rem}
.bal-ico{font-size:1.35rem;line-height:1}
.bal-top h3{font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;flex:1;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif}
.bal-pct{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--terracotta)}
.bar{height:7px;border-radius:99px;background:#F1E8DA;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:.7rem}
.bar span{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--terracotta),var(--amber))}
.bal-card p{font-size:.87rem;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.55}

/* ============ 8. PASOS ============ */
.steps{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:1rem;counter-reset:paso}
.steps li{
  counter-increment:paso;
  background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;
  padding:1.25rem 1.4rem 1.25rem 4.2rem;position:relative;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);
}
.steps li::before{
  content:counter(paso);
  position:absolute;left:1.25rem;top:1.2rem;
  width:2.1rem;height:2.1rem;border-radius:50%;
  display:grid;place-items:center;
  background:var(--terracotta);color:#fff;
  font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1rem;
}
.steps h3{font-size:1.02rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.3rem;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif}
.steps p{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
.steps .time{
  display:inline-block;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);background:var(--green-soft);
  padding:.2rem .6rem;border-radius:99px;margin-top:.55rem;
}

/* ============ 9. BLOQUE INFANTIL ============ */
.kids{
  background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--green) 0%,#2E4232 100%);
  color:#F3F6F1;border-radius:26px;padding:clamp(1.6rem,4vw,2.8rem);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.kids::after{
  content:"";position:absolute;width:280px;height:280px;right:-90px;top:-90px;
  border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(232,163,61,.28),transparent 70%);
}
.kids h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3.6vw,2.1rem);margin-bottom:.6rem;position:relative;z-index:1}
.kids .eyebrow{color:var(--amber)}
.kids p{color:rgba(243,246,241,.82);position:relative;z-index:1}
.kids-list{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:.7rem;margin-top:1.4rem;position:relative;z-index:1}
.kids-list li{
  display:flex;gap:.75rem;align-items:flex-start;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);
  border-radius:14px;padding:.85rem 1rem;font-size:.92rem;
}
.kids-list .tick{
  flex:0 0 auto;width:1.35rem;height:1.35rem;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--amber);color:#2B2118;display:grid;place-items:center;
  font-size:.75rem;font-weight:900;margin-top:.1rem;
}

/* ============ 10. CALLOUT ============ */
.callout{
  display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start;
  background:#FDF3E4;border:1px solid #F0D9B4;border-left:5px solid var(--amber);
  border-radius:14px;padding:1.1rem 1.3rem;margin-top:1.6rem;
}
.callout .ico{font-size:1.35rem;line-height:1}
.callout strong{display:block;margin-bottom:.2rem;font-size:.95rem}
.callout p{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}

/* ============ 11. FOOTER ============ */
footer{
  background:#2B2118;color:rgba(251,247,240,.65);
  padding:2.4rem 0;margin-top:2rem;font-size:.85rem;
}
.foot-inner{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
footer strong{color:#FBF7F0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1rem}

/* ============ 12. ANIMACIÓN DE ENTRADA ============ */
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){
  .fade{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease}
  .fade.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
}

/* ============ 13. IMPRESIÓN ============ */
@media print{
  .topbar,.hero::after,.btn-cta,.seg{display:none}
  body{background:#fff}
  .hero{background:#fff;color:#000}
  .kids{background:#fff;color:#000;border:1px solid #ccc}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============ BARRA SUPERIOR ============ -->
<header class="topbar">
  <div class="wrap topbar-inner">
    <div class="brand"><span class="brand-dot"></span> Sopa Criolla de Raíces</div>
    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="#ingredientes">Ingredientes</a>
      <a href="#nutricion">Nutrición</a>
      <a href="#preparacion">Preparación</a>
      <a href="#ninos">Para la niña</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="btn-cta" href="#ingredientes">Ver la lista →</a>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Receta calculada al gramo</span>
      <h1>Sopa Criolla de Res y Raíces <em>para 3</em>, sin que sobre ni falte</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">
        Un plato principal espeso y completo —res, yuca, ñame, auyama, maíz y verduras—
        con las cantidades exactas para dos adultos y una niña de 2 años.
        Compra justo, cocina una vez, come bien.
      </p>
      <div class="badges">
        <span class="badge">🍲 3 porciones exactas</span>
        <span class="badge">⏱️ ~70 minutos</span>
        <span class="badge">🚫 Cero desperdicio</span>
        <span class="badge">👶 Apta para niños</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="ficha">
      <h2>Ficha de la receta</h2>
      <div class="ficha-grid">
        <div class="ficha-item"><strong>3</strong><span>porciones (2 ad. + 1 niña)</span></div>
        <div class="ficha-item"><strong>70′</strong><span>tiempo total</span></div>
        <div class="ficha-item"><strong>~550</strong><span>kcal por ración adulto</span></div>
        <div class="ficha-item"><strong>1.2 L</strong><span>de agua</span></div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============ INGREDIENTES ============ -->
<section id="ingredientes">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head fade">
      <span class="eyebrow">Paso 0 · La compra</span>
      <h2>Lista de compras con rendimiento exacto</h2>
      <p>
        Estas son las cantidades para <strong>tres platos servidos</strong>: dos raciones de adulto
        y una ración infantil. Cambia el conmutador para ver cuánto corresponde a
        <strong>una sola ración de adulto</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="switch-row">
      <div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Selector de cantidades">
        <button class="seg-btn active" data-mode="full" type="button">Compra total · 3 personas</button>
        <button class="seg-btn" data-mode="unit" type="button">Por 1 adulto</button>
      </div>
      <p class="seg-note" id="notaRacion">
        Compra total: rinde 2 platos de adulto + 1 plato infantil. No sobra comida.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="tbl-wrap fade">
      <table class="tbl">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Ingrediente</th><th>Cantidad</th><th>Nota de compra</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Carne de res — lagarto sin hueso</td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="300 g" data-unit="120 g">300 g</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">Si eliges costilla, pide que la deshuesen y suma 100 g por el hueso.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Yuca <strong>con concha</strong></td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="300 g" data-unit="120 g">300 g</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">La cáscara y las puntas pesan ~30%. Rinde 200 g netos.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Maíz (mazorca)</td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="1 unidad (~150 g)" data-unit="60 g de granos">1 unidad (~150 g)</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">Una mazorca mediana. Cortar en 3 trozos.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Auyama</td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="150 g" data-unit="60 g">150 g</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">Peso neto, sin semillas ni cáscara.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Ñame</td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="150 g" data-unit="60 g">150 g</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">Pelado. Da cuerpo al caldo.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Papa</td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="150 g (1 mediana)" data-unit="60 g">150 g (1 mediana)</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">Prefiere papa que no se deshaga.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Zanahoria</td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="80 g (1 mediana)" data-unit="32 g">80 g (1 mediana)</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">Fuente clave de vitamina A.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Cilantro</td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="15 g (1 manojo pequeño)" data-unit="6 g">15 g (1 manojo pequeño)</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">Se añade al final, fuera del fuego.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Cebollín</td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="20 g (2 tallos)" data-unit="8 g">20 g (2 tallos)</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">Usa tallo y parte verde.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Ají dulce</td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="10 g (1 unidad)" data-unit="4 g">10 g (1 unidad)</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">Sin semillas para suavizar el sabor.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Pimentón</td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="30 g (¼ unidad)" data-unit="12 g">30 g (¼ unidad)</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">Aporta vitamina C.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Cebolla</td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="50 g (½ unidad)" data-unit="20 g">50 g (½ unidad)</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">Base del sofrito.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Ajo</td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="7 g (2 dientes)" data-unit="3 g">7 g (2 dientes)</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">Machacado, no picado fino.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Comino</td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="1 g (½ cdta)" data-unit="0.4 g">1 g (½ cdta)</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">Moderado: su sabor es intenso para niños.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Sal</td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="Al gusto (iniciar con 1 cdta)" data-unit="Al gusto">Al gusto</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">Salar después de separar el plato de la niña.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Ingrediente">Agua</td>
            <td data-label="Cantidad" class="qty" data-full="1.2 litros" data-unit="480 ml">1.2 litros</td>
            <td data-label="Nota" class="note">Hasta 1.5 L si la prefieres más calduda.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="callout">
      <span class="ico">🧾</span>
      <div>
        <strong>Regla de oro contra el desperdicio</strong>
        <p>Compra la yuca el mismo día o el día anterior: se oxida rápido. Si te sobra algún tallo de cebollín o cilantro, pícalo y congélalo en cubetera con agua — sirve para la próxima sopa.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ NUTRICIÓN ============ -->
<section id="nutricion" style="background:#F6EFE4">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head fade">
      <span class="eyebrow">Paso 0.5 · El equilibrio</span>
      <h2>Qué aporta una ración de adulto</h2>
      <p>
        Valores estimados para <strong>una porción de adulto</strong> (≈470 g de sólidos + 480 ml de caldo),
        calculados con carne magra de lagarto y sin aceite añadido.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="tbl-wrap fade" style="margin-bottom:1.6rem">
